```console
$ scherzo-cloud organization create --help
Create an organization

Usage: scherzo-cloud organization create [OPTIONS] --display-name <NAME>

Options:
      --display-name <NAME>
          Set the organization display name
      --slug <SLUG>
          Request an exact organization slug
      --delegator-principal-id <PRINCIPAL>
          Attribute delegated service creation to an exact human principal
      --json
          Print the organization result as JSON
      --service-api-key-file <PATH|->
          Authenticate with a service API key from a private file, or - for standard input
      --allow-insecure-http
          Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help
          Print help

```
